Description: Python API for TP-Link Kasa and Tapo smart devices
 python-kasa controls TP-Link Kasa and Tapo smart plugs, power strips,
 switches, bulbs and cameras on the local network, without the vendor's
 cloud. It provides an asyncio library and the "kasa" command-line tool.
 .
 This build is a snapshot of upstream git, for the KLAP v2 login fix that
 EP10 plugs on firmware 1.1.x need, which is not in a release yet.
